@startuml
title Pizza night
actor Guest
participant App
participant Kitchen
participant Courier

Guest -> App : order a pizza
App -> Kitchen : new order
activate Kitchen
Kitchen --> App : 25 minutes
App --> Guest : on its way soon
loop until it is done
  Kitchen -> Kitchen : bake
end
Kitchen -> Courier : pick up
deactivate Kitchen
alt at the door
  Courier -> Guest : hand over
  Guest --> Courier : tip
else nobody home
  Courier -> App : not delivered
  App --> Guest : call us
end
@enduml
